title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/sangerbund.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and radio.

= Media

The KPD runs a veritable media empire, with many newspapers throughout every German city and region. We could use the media for various purposes...

- @commercial
- @campaign
- @ideological
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@commercial
title: Make our newspapers more commercialized by broadening their appeal beyond party supporters.
subtitle: This might upset ideological purists, but it may bring in more funds and perhaps expose nationalistic workers to communist views.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; workers_kpd += 4*(1 - dissent); ultra-left_dissent += 10; left-opposition_dissent += 10

Our commercialized newspapers are able to bring in more funds. However, the Ultra-left and Left Opposition factions express their displeasure.

@campaign
title: The purpose of our media is to elect more Social Democrats.
subtitle: Our newspapers will focus on the electoral campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent);

Our campaign media is mostly reaching the workers who are already saturated with Communist propaganda, but it must be doing *something*, or at least that is what we hope.

@ideological
title: We will have vibrant ideological debate within our newspapers.
subtitle: There will be space for all factions to air their views.
on-arrival: ultra-left_dissent -= 6; left-opposition_dissent -= 6; conciliator_dissent -= 6; right_dissent -= 6

This seems to be successfully paving over the many tensions in our party.

@radio
title: Why not fund a radio station?
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 2; workers_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent) if pacifism > 1; pro_republic -= 3*(1-dissent)

Our new radio station allows us to connect to people in a more intimate setting than before, spreading the message of socialism along with music and other popular content. Since most proletarians cannot afford family radios right now, our effectiveness is limited.

@radio_2
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_kpd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our new radio network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success.

@radio_3
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: It is now financially self-sufficient, and does not require any more resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5 and year <= 1931
on-arrival: radio += 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our radio network has become a successful tool for spreading our message.

@radio_4
title: We should keep on supporting our radio network.
subtitle: As radio becomes more common, the novelty is beginning to wear off, and radio is becoming saturated in society. -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and (radio >= 6 or year >= 1932) and radio <= 9
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

We are continuing to invest in our radio stations. Both commercial and political radio are becoming more prevalent, making it harder to spread our message amidst the competition.
